---
import { stackItems } from '../data/site';
---

<section class="section-shell engineering-section" id="engineering" data-section-index="03" aria-labelledby="engineering-title">
  <div class="section-top">
    <span class="section-code">02 / EXPERIÊNCIA</span>
    <span class="section-status">8 ÁREAS DE ATUAÇÃO</span>
  </div>

  <div class="section-heading section-heading--wide reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">O QUE EU FAÇO</p>
      <h2 id="engineering-title">EXPERIÊNCIA PARA<br />RESOLVER PROBLEMAS.</h2>
      <p>Uma visão prática das ferramentas e áreas que fazem parte do meu trabalho. Escolha uma para ver onde ela entra.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="engineering-grid">
    <div class="stack-index reveal">
      <p class="index-heading">ÁREAS DE EXPERIÊNCIA</p>
      <div class="stack-list" role="tablist" aria-label="Áreas de experiência">
        {
          stackItems.map((item, index) => (
            <button
              type="button"
              role="tab"
              class="stack-item"
              aria-selected={index === 0 ? 'true' : 'false'}
              aria-controls="stack-detail"
              data-stack-option
              data-stack-id={item.id}
              data-number={item.number}
              data-title={item.title}
              data-description={item.description}
              data-context={item.context}
              data-label={item.label}
              data-cursor-target
            >
              <span>{item.number}</span>
              <strong>{item.label}</strong>
              <span aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </button>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="stack-detail reveal" id="stack-detail" role="tabpanel" aria-live="polite">
      <p class="micro-label" data-stack-context>{stackItems[0].context}</p>
      <p class="stack-detail__code" data-stack-code>{stackItems[0].number} / {stackItems[0].label}</p>
      <h3 data-stack-title>{stackItems[0].title}</h3>
      <p data-stack-description>{stackItems[0].description}</p>
      <span class="stack-detail__rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <p class="stack-detail__note">Tecnologia é meio. O contexto vem primeiro.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
